[statement]
Reduced from a layered request over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`,
2026-11-11): `py3-python-socks`'s closure from v3.23 installed, `gimp`
asked. `gimp` needs `py3-cairo`, which needs `python3~3.14`; the world's
`py3-python-socks`, installed, needs `python3~3.12`, and the repository
offers a later version of it that states no version of `python3`. apk
upgrades `python3` and `py3-python-socks`. `python3~3.14` is required
through `py3-cairo`, the single candidate of a name `gimp` needs, before
`py3-cairo` is installed
(`installed/a-sole-candidate-s-constraint-upgrades-an-installed-package`),
and the upgrade reaches the installed dependent as in
`installed/an-upgrade-the-request-needs-reaches-an-installed-dependent`.

[repository]
P:py3-cairo
V:1.28.0-r1
D:python3~3.14

P:python3
V:3.14.10-r1

[repository]
P:gimp
V:3.2.4-r0
D:py3-cairo

P:py3-python-socks
V:2.8.1-r0

[installed]
P:python3
V:3.12.16-r0

P:py3-python-socks
V:2.4.4-r1
D:python3~3.12

[world]
py3-python-socks

[request]
gimp

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
upgrade python3 3.12.16-r0 3.14.10-r1
install py3-cairo 1.28.0-r1
install gimp 3.2.4-r0
upgrade py3-python-socks 2.4.4-r1 2.8.1-r0
